{"overview":"A coming-of-age story about an outsider who, against all odds and numerous challenges, fights for love and acceptance and for her place in the world. The series centers on a young orphaned girl in the late 1890s, who, after an abusive childhood spent in orphanages and the homes of strangers, is mistakenly sent to live with an elderly woman and her aging brother. Over time, 13-year-old Anne will transform their lives and eventually the small town in which they live with her unique spirit, fierce intellect and brilliant imagination.","tagline":"","overview_en":"","tagline_en":"Welcome back to Green Gables.","runtime":47,"status":"Canceled","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":7,"y":2017,"poster":"/lqoGVD3FCahM9faB2SWdpae9Ejt.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2018,"poster":"/7bjv63bF07F2SiN6PoJHYqmYRoR.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2019,"poster":"/hSjv6QkGknuJrB8LTjYFv5SPjrr.jpg"}],"episodes":27,"crew":["مویرا ولی-بیکت"],"crew_en":["Moira Walley-Beckett"],"countries":["CA"],"cast":[{"name":"ایمیبث مک‌نالتی","role":"Anne Shirley","photo":"/5U8lw3U3spt7Q70rceSOryvfteP.jpg","en":"Amybeth McNulty"},{"name":"جرالدین جیمز","role":"Marilla Cuthbert","photo":"/szGMl8MRuOPKb45xH36uH85xNhd.jpg","en":"Geraldine James"},{"name":"R.H. Thomson","role":"Matthew Cuthbert","photo":"/j9RIw8mC5CpMRToDfUCzFgPGDhK.jpg"},{"name":"Lucas Jade Zumann","role":"Gilbert Blythe","photo":"/t0GMKfDanKkkcwCxIL4psFxSVgi.jpg"},{"name":"Joanna Douglas","role":"Miss Stacy","photo":"/54Pa51ZifNKRCpKqsP1uQp50uk0.jpg"}],"trailer":"S5qJXYNNINo","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70785-anne-with-an-e/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6V.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70785-anne-with-an-e/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Netfl